</div>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant hover-lift"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Dental Abscess</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Throbbing pain with facial swelling from an infected tooth. Pain often radiates to the ear, temple, or neck. Requires drainage and tooth treatment.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant hover-lift"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">dermatology</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">TMJ Disorders</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Jaw joint inflammation causing pain in front of the ear with swelling of the joint area. Movement worsens the pain.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant hover-lift"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">warning</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Sinus Infections</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Maxillary sinus infections cause facial pain and pressure, particularly over the cheekbones, with swelling possible around the eyes.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant hover-lift"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">coronavirus</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Trigeminal Neuralgia</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Sharp, electric-shock-like facial pain that can accompany swelling during flare-ups. Affects the trigeminal nerve distribution.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant hover-lift"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Salivary Gland Disorders</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Blocked salivary ducts and infections cause pain and swelling in the cheek and under the jaw, worsening with eating.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant hover-lift"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">bug_report</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Shingles (Herpes Zoster)</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Shingles affecting the facial nerve causes painful vesicular eruptions with swelling along the nerve distribution.</p></div>
