<details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-lg [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-primary">When should I seek emergency care for facial pain and swelling?<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180">expand_more</span></summary>
